  /// The agent who introduced this buyer, when one did. Set from the ?ref=
  /// on a shared link, or chosen by the developer when logging it manually.
  /// SetNull rather than Cascade: losing an agent must not erase the
  /// developer's booking.
  agentId     String?
  agent       AgentProfile? @relation(fields: [agentId], references: [id], onDelete: SetNull)
